93/jxb/erx052" target="_blank" data-event="articleReference-a-crossRef">CrossRef </a></li><li class="References__links__item"><a href="http://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?author=J..%2BUrban&amp;author=M.%2BW..%2BIngwers&amp;author=M.%2BA..%2BMcGuire&amp;author=R.%2BO..%2BTeskey&amp;publication_year=2017&amp;title=Increase%2Bin%2Bleaf%2Btemperature%2Bopens%2Bstomata%2Band%2Bdecouples%2Bnet%2Bphotosynthesis%2Bfrom%2Bstomatal%2Bconductance%2Bin%2BPinus%2Btaeda%2Band%2BPopulus%2Bdeltoides%2Bx%2Bnigra&amp;journal=J.+Exp.+Bot.&amp;volume=68&amp;pages=1757-1767" target="_blank" data-event="articleReference-a-googleScholar">Google Scholar</a></li><!----></ul></div></li><li class="References__item" id="B46"><div class="References__label"><p>46</p></div><div class="References__content"><p class="notranslate"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span person-group-type="author" class="References__personGroup"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__name"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__surname">Vanderwel</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__givenNames">M. C.</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__name"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__surname">Slot</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__givenNames">M.</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__name"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__surname">Lichstein</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__givenNames">J. W.</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__name"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__surname">Reich</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__givenNames">P. B.</span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></span><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="References__name"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><span class="Refe